> [!WARNING]
> **FE-14: The 1-second clock timer re-renders the ENTIRE application shell every second.** Every child component of `DashboardLayoutCore` receives new props each second, triggering full subtree reconciliation. For a page with 500 table rows, this means 500+ DOM diff operations every second, even when nothing changed. This single issue likely causes 90%+ of perceived UI jank.

