## AUDIT AREA 7 — LARGE DATASET HANDLING

### 7.1 Scalability Assessment

| Component | Current Query | At 5000 Candidates | Impact |
|-----------|-------------|-------------------|--------|
| OnboardingCenter | `profiles.select('*').eq('role', 'candidate')` | **5000 rows loaded** | Browser OOM risk |
| CandidatePipeline | `candidate_applications.select(*, candidates(*), job_forms(*))` | **10000+ rows with JOINs** | 10+ second load, UI freeze |
| ApplicationHub | `job_applications.select('*')` + client-side join | **10000 rows + O(n×m) join** | JavaScript thread blocked |
