| CandidateMessages | `profiles.select('id, name, email').eq('role', 'candidate')` | **5000 rows in sidebar** | DOM overflow |

### 7.2 Recommendations

| Pattern | When to Use | Libraries |
|---------|------------|-----------|
| **Cursor-based pagination** | All list views (applications, candidates, employees) | React Query `useInfiniteQuery` |
| **Virtualization** | Tables with 100+ rows | `@tanstack/react-virtual` |
| **Infinite scroll** | Chat messages, notifications | Intersection Observer API |
| **Server-side search** | Candidate/employee search | PostgreSQL `ILIKE` or `pg_trgm` |
| **Server-side aggregation** | Dashboard metrics | Database views/functions |

