### 9.2 Recommended DSA Improvements

| Structure | Where to Apply | Benefit |
|-----------|---------------|---------|
| **Hash Map** (`Map<id, entity>`) | All client-side joins (ApplicationHub, CandidateInterviews) | O(n × m) → O(n + m) |
| **Debounced search** | All search inputs | Reduce filter calls from 10/s to 3/s |
| **Memoized derived data** (`useMemo`) | All `.filter()`, `.sort()`, `.map()` chains in render | Avoid recalculation on unrelated re-renders |
| **Server-side aggregation** | All dashboard metrics | Eliminate client-side O(n) loops entirely |
| **Virtualized lists** | Candidate lists, application tables | Render 20 rows instead of 5000 |

